+{"id":"fabro-2c81","title":"Scope skill discovery to workflow skills dir","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-02T17:53:22.565Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-03T17:28:43.994Z","description":"Scope skill source dirs per workflow/node in agent settings to .fabro/skills, dropping /storage/.home/skills for the develop workflow. Run 01M0QJ01P9E6EKX8S6TQN91G8E's agent.skills.discovered event pulled 36 skills (personal ones like ask-matt, scaffold-exercises) into a planner that only needs sd, adding discovery time and prompt bloat against a tight preamble_budget_kb=12. Expected effect: smaller preambles, less role-prompt distraction, and removal of the skill-token crash class the prompts defensively work around.","labels":["revision"]}
